      "releaseNotes": "-Travel Mode is now available — enable it for your trips and the app adapts to your location.\n-Apple Watch App support\n-Add new widgets by selecting **Edit Widgets**, then choose your preferred widget type and theme (Light or Dark)\n-Hijri date adjustments\n-Possibility to add an external Athan audio or record your own Athan\n-Bug fixes and performance improvement",
